{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>Which have no legs.</b> The essential thing is that it have them, with a vav." "<b>To leap.</b> It has no cognate [of its root]. The translator [Onkelos] said לקפצא בהון, like מקפץ, and its meaning is skipping, and he translated truthfully."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:09:29.519033240Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}